{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7541b25806372e71","name":"Greethka","source":{"id":"source:reference-7541b25806372e71","title":"Greethka","revision":21601,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:07:14Z","sha256":"8a6ed4a8341a3b64cc719899f08937f958abd9bb0a393cff08c6a0cbdd250948","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21601","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Greethka&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7541b25806372e71","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Sword of the Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sword_of_the_Empire","referenceId":"reference:56baf6e19ed21c48"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["The water in the pool glows, but it's not just the shiny goo that's dripping off the stalactites. There's something organic to the way the water is shimmering."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Wait- that's not water..."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Motile slimes, molds, and jellies are well suited to life in the subterranean wilderness of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prakith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prakith","referenceId":"reference:a2d3eea7dbab0257"},". Many live on the heat and energy provided by the lava and magma of the underworld, but others have adapted and evolved to take advantage of other resources, whether organic or inorganic. The gelatinous masses known to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stereb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stereb","referenceId":"reference:ba0059137d05cad7"}," as Greethka eat everything.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Normal adult Greethka grow to about 2 meters in width, a perfect size for oozing through the passages of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prakith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prakith","referenceId":"reference:a2d3eea7dbab0257"},". They vary in shape from a glistening, bulging sphere to a flat, slimy pancake, depending on what they're digesting. In any form, they can extrude one to three 3-squarelong pseudopods from any section of their body, with which they grab and pin their food source. Wild Greethka prefer to live in large placid ponds fed by underground waters, but sometimes they live in fast-moving rivers through which they swim, as fast as a fish, in a wormlike form. They are greenish-brown in color and slightly translucent; large globules (often remains of recent repasts) float at random within their bodies.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As the heroes learn later if they quiz ",{"tag":"a","children":["Herdr'tui"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Herdr%27tui","referenceId":"reference:816a4a0294fd4788"},", the Greethka in this cavern is an aberration. Greethka whose diets are not regulated grow uncontrollably. That's the case with the 2-square-diameter Greethka in the pond in the cavern; its been living off the debris dumped by the Empire.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Greethka Statistics (CL 15)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge Aquatic Subterranean ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," 16\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +13; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," Heat Sense, Tremorsense, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 8 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},