://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crush","referenceId":"reference:fd4982bc31020a05"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pin","referenceId":"reference:ff1cee74414621d8"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training (Initiative)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Initiative)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training (Stealth)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training_(Stealth)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," +3, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," -7\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Special Qualities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Envelop:"]}," A Greethka can envelop Large or smaller creatures with its body, automatically crushing them for 2d8+30 points of damage. A creature that was ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pinned"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pinned"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crushed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crushed"}," in the prior round and does not escape the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," by the next round is automatically Enveloped, cannot attempt to break the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"},", and cannot escape on its own in subsequent rounds.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Greethka can Envelop one Large creature, two Medium creatures, or four Small or smaller creatures at one time. Enveloped creatures need not fear ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acid"}," damage, since the Greethka begins digesting its prey only after it is safe from other attacks and the prey ceases breathing and struggling.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Heat Sense:"]}," A Greethka can sense heat through sensors just under the surface of its outer membrane. These sensors are scattered around its entire body. The sensors allow the Greethka to detect heat signatures from anything within 15 squares using a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Tremorsense:"]}," A Greethka does not see and hear in the regular sense. Instead, it automatically senses the location of anything that is in contact with the ground and within 100 squares (no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check required). The creature is not affected by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Visibility"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Visibility","referenceId":"reference:7448611d5f93aa8a"},", but it is highly sensitive to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sonic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sonic"}," effects.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A simple claxon or alarm can keep a Greethka at bay for 1d6 rounds until it gets its bearings, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sonic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sonic"},"-based weapons (including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibroblades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibroblades"}," and the like) deal double damage.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
